Subject: [PATCH] Add alternating navy/bright section bands with gold +
 electric-blue accents

- New --navy-*, --gold, --electric-blue CSS vars in :root
- .band-navy theme class: dark section bg, gold eyebrows/tags, electric-blue links, frosted-dark .glass panels
- Applied band-navy to alternate every page's 2nd and 4th content section (category grid/product grid + footer on home/shop pages; split + cta-band on about; contact-grid + footer on contact)
- Fixed --text-muted (was undefined, now aliases --muted)
- Added missing .footer-bottom, .footer-grid ul/h4, .split .visual/.copy rules (were completely unstyled before, independent of this change)
